ion (от InfernalStudios)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/lava-monsters\" rel=\"nofollow\">Lava Monsters (от ModdingLegacy)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eidolon\" rel=\"nofollow\">Eidolon (от elucent_)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/game-stages\" rel=\"nofollow\">Game Stages (от DarkhaxDev)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/unionlib\" rel=\"nofollow\">UnionLib (от Stereowalker)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/savage-and-ravage\" rel=\"nofollow\">Savage &amp; Ravage (от TeamAbnormals)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ai-improvements\" rel=\"nofollow\">AI Improvements (от QueenOfMissiles)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/direbats-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">🦇 Direbats (Forge 1.16.5) (от andantet)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/yungs-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">YUNG's API (Forge) (от YUNGNICKYOUNG)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/drp-global-datapack\" rel=\"nofollow\">Global Data- &amp; Resourcepacks (от JTK222)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/allurement\" rel=\"nofollow\">Allurement (от TeamAbnormals)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/spawner-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Spawner Bug Fix (от MacTso)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/snowballs-freeze-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Snowballs Freeze Mobs (Forge) (от Serilum)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons (от sbom_xela)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/extra-food-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Extra Food Recipes (от guet1440)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/greater-eye-of-ender-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\">Greater Eye of Ender [FORGE] (от kwpugh)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sit\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sit (от bl4ckscor3)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cherished-worlds\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cherished Worlds (Forge) (от TheIllusiveC4)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/angry-mobs\" rel=\"nofollow\">Angry Mobs (от Mrbysco)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/berry-good\" rel=\"nofollow\">Berry Good (от TeamAbnormals)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/chocolate-fix\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chocolate Fix (от AlcatrazEscapee)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei-integration\" rel=\"nofollow\">JEI Integration (от SnowShock35)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios API (Forge) (от TheIllusiveC4)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caves-and-cliffs-backport\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caves &amp; Cliffs Backport (от blackgear27)</a></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/dungeon-crawl\" rel=\"nofollow\">Dungeon Crawl (от xiroc_)</a></li>\n<li style=\